        "en": "Label supports use only in some paediatric ages; check the age in the label text."
      },
      "quote": "The safety and effectiveness of cefuroxime axetil have been established for pediatric patients aged 3 months to 12 years for acute bacterial maxillary sinusitis based upon its approval in adults.",
